# `data/*` rather than `data/`: git will not descend into an excluded directory,
# so the negations below would not apply. The EDGAR ingestion script and its two
# deliverables are tracked; the 71MB raw API cache, the local app database and
# the regenerable CSV exports are not.
data/*
!data/ingest_edgar.py
!data/extract_panel_sample.py
!data/coverage_report.md
!data/panel_extract.md
!data/panel_shortlist.csv
!data/edgar.db
